// Weave Transfusion: deliberately simplified to a large instant heal on a
// touched ally, per an explicit design call ("no te compliques") rather than
// the sheet's original life-transfer mechanic.
//
// `SelfBuff` cannot deliver this -- that ability variant always lands its
// effect on the caster (`entity: data.entity` in
// `common/src/states/self_buff.rs`), never on a touched ally. Shipped instead
// as `BasicMelee` using the exact touch-ally pattern already shipped for
// `lesser_restoration.ron`/`greater_restoration.ron`
// (`attack_effect_target: Some(InGroup)` on a near-inert melee hit).
//
// `CombatEffect::Heal(f32)` (`common/src/combat.rs`) already derives
// `Deserialize` and was already exposed by `melee_constructor.attack_effect`
// -- it had simply never been authored in any shipped RON before this file.
// Magnitude follows the same convention `AdditionalDamage`'s sibling f32
// fields use elsewhere (a raw magnitude scaled by the caster's own stats at
// resolution time, here `heal_power` -- see `CombatEffect::Heal`'s handling
// in `common/src/combat.rs`).
BasicMelee(
    energy_cost: 90.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    swing_duration: 0.1,
    hit_timing: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    melee_constructor: (
        kind: Stab(damage: 1, poise: 0, knockback: 0, energy_regen: 0),
        range: 3.0,
        angle: 20.0,
        attack_effect: Some((
            Heal(200.0),
            AnyDamage,
        )),
        attack_effect_target: Some(InGroup),
    ),
    meta: (
        school: Some(Transmutation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 7 spell -> min_level 42, same `level * 6` convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(42)),
    ),
)
